Package: LithoGas
Type: Package
Title: Monte Carlo Modelling for Geologic Hydrogen and Helium
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Daniel", "Coutts", email = "daniel.coutts@nrcan-rncan.gc.ca",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Oliver", "Warr", role = "aut"),
    person("Omid", "Ardakani", role = "aut"),
    person("Barbara", "Sherwood Lollar", role = "aut"))
Description: Provides Monte Carlo modelling of hydrogen and helium generation
    rates via radiolysis and serpentinization models, extended to economic
    estimations incorporating source area volume plots and deep time production
    estimates. Implements radiolysis methods of Warr et al. (2023)
   <doi:10.3389/feart.2023.1150086> and serpentinization methods of
    Ardakani et al. (2026) <doi:XXXXXXXX>.
